// D1587 — the `i32 | null` an `x as? u8` yields, delivered everywhere. `u8` is a STORAGE
// type, so `x as u8` used to be a loud check reject; the ruling makes it the SAME
// exact-or-fail narrowing `x as i32` is, with 0..255 as the domain and an `i32` as the value.
//
// The rep is the union BOX, so this is the position matrix D1041's own trio owed and the
// `u8` domain inherits: every position that can hold an `i32 | null` has to hold this one.
// A cell that came out SILENT would be the box row registered under the wrong NAME — the
// spelling is `u8` and the box is `i32|null`, which is exactly the pair this fix keeps apart.
//
// The PROOF coalesces, so a cell that lost the null tag prints -1 rather than 200.
//
// Format: scripts/capability-probes/matrix.py, whose docstring is the spec.
// @@PRELUDE@@
function inRange(): f64 { return 200.0 }
function tooBig(): f64 { return 300.0 }
// @@VALUE@@
inRange() as? u8
// @@TYPE@@
i32 | null
// @@PROOF@@
print(v ?? -1)
// @@WANT@@
200
// @@VALUE2@@
tooBig() as? u8
// @@TYPE2@@
i32 | null
// @@PROOF2@@
print(v ?? -1)
// @@WANT2@@
-1
// @@SKIP@@
is_in_if: `v is i32` over an `i32 | null` is the nullable narrowing, not this cast's question
is_in_while: same
is_in_and: same
is_in_not: same
else_if: same
early_return_guard: same
